  ("COMPUTER SECURITY INCIDENT HANDLING GUIDE" 0.58678 0.88244 0.04578 0.05845 0.05791 0.0098 0.00316 0.3183 0.0676 "Arial" 0.0088 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("41" 0.49106 0.5091 0.93891 0.95434 0.95434 0.01543 0.00451 0.0000 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("– Determining if the actual cause of the incident was identified, and identifying the vector of attack," 0.1471 0.88077 0.0912 0.10797 0.10797 0.01543 0.00451 0.3387 0.0098 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("the vulnerabilities exploited, and the characteristics of the targeted or victimized systems," 0.1765 0.81959 0.10821 0.12364 0.12364 0.01543 0.00451 0.2867 0.0221 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("networks, and applications" 0.1765 0.36873 0.12427 0.1397 0.1397 0.01543 0.00451 0.2767 0.0705 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("– Determining if the incident is a recurrence of a previous incident" 0.1471 0.6415 0.15168 0.16845 0.16845 0.01543 0.00451 0.3515 0.0098 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("– Calculating the estimated monetary damage from the incident (e.g., information and critical" 0.1471 0.83543 0.18016 0.19693 0.19693 0.01543 0.00451 0.3642 0.0098 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("business processes negatively affected by the incident)" 0.1765 0.56978 0.19715 0.21258 0.21258 0.01543 0.00451 0.2280 0.0611 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("– Measuring the difference between the initial impact assessment and the final impact assessment" 0.1471 0.86387 0.22471 0.24148 0.24148 0.01543 0.00451 0.3572 0.0098 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("(see Section 3.2.6)" 0.1765 0.3103 0.2417 0.25713 0.25713 0.01543 0.00451 0.2666 0.0291 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("– Identifying which measures, if any, could have prevented the incident." 0.1471 0.68276 0.2691 0.28587 0.28587 0.01543 0.00451 0.3397 0.0098 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Subjective Assessment of Each Incident. Incident response team members may be asked to assess" 2 42 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86496 0.29761 0.31304 0.31304 0.01543 0.00451 0.3317 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("their own performance, as well as that of other team members and of the entire team. Another" 0.1471 0.82102 0.31351 0.32895 0.32895 0.01543 0.00451 0.3464 0.0331 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("valuable source of input is the owner of a resource that was attacked, in order to determine if the" 0.1471 0.8406 0.32946 0.34489 0.34489 0.01543 0.00451 0.2973 0.0611 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("owner thinks the incident was handled efficiently and if the outcome was satisfactory." 0.1471 0.76413 0.34552 0.36095 0.36095 0.01543 0.00451 0.3030 0.0450 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("Besides using these metrics to measure the team’s success, organizations may also find it useful to" 0.11769 0.82553 0.37279 0.38823 0.38823 0.01543 0.00451 0.3060 0.0560 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("periodically audit their incident response programs. Audits will identify problems and deficiencies that" 0.11769 0.85688 0.38886 0.40429 0.40429 0.01543 0.00451 0.3036 0.0861 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("can then be corrected. At a minimum, an incident response audit should evaluate the following items" 0.11769 0.84176 0.40476 0.4202 0.4202 0.01543 0.00451 0.3237 0.0251 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("against applicable regulations, policies, and generally accepted practices:" 0.11769 0.6433 0.42067 0.4361 0.4361 0.01543 0.00451 0.2428 0.0510 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (" Incident response policies, plans, and procedures" 0.11769 0.4992 0.45189 0.46732 0.46732 0.01543 0.00451 0.3114 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (" Tools and resources" 0.11769 0.29089 0.47916 0.49459 0.49459 0.01543 0.00451 0.3466 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (" Team model and structure" 0.11769 0.33543 0.50658 0.52201 0.52201 0.01543 0.00451 0.3791 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (" Incident handler training and education" 0.11769 0.42972 0.53388 0.54931 0.54931 0.01543 0.00451 0.3266 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (" Incident documentation and reports" 0.11769 0.40205 0.56115 0.57658 0.57658 0.01543 0.00451 0.3404 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (" The measures of success discussed earlier in this section." 0.11769 0.55691 0.58858 0.60401 0.60401 0.01543 0.00451 0.3284 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (#("3.4.3 Evidence Retention" 0 24 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.34358 0.61581 0.63135 0.63135 0.01554 0.00501 0.3363 0.0402 "Arial,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  ("Organizations should establish policy for how long evidence from an incident should be retained. Most" 0.11769 0.8591 0.64706 0.66249 0.66249 0.01543 0.00451 0.3045 0.1009 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("organizations choose to retain all evidence for months or years after the incident ends. The following" 0.11769 0.84365 0.66297 0.6784 0.6784 0.01543 0.00451 0.2813 0.0970 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("factors should be considered during the policy creation:" 0.11769 0.51725 0.67903 0.69446 0.69446 0.01543 0.00451 0.2454 0.0489 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Prosecution. If it is possible that the attacker will be prosecuted, evidence may need to be retained" 2 15 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.85781 0.71009 0.72552 0.72552 0.01543 0.00451 0.3247 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("until all legal actions have been completed. In some cases, this may take several years. Furthermore," 0.1471 0.86852 0.726 0.74143 0.74143 0.01543 0.00451 0.3077 0.0331 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("evidence that seems insignificant now may become more important in the future. For example, if an" 0.1471 0.86551 0.74206 0.75749 0.75749 0.01543 0.00451 0.3342 0.0641 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("attacker is able to use knowledge gathered in one attack to perform a more severe attack later," 0.1471 0.82128 0.75801 0.77344 0.77344 0.01543 0.00451 0.2924 0.0569 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("evidence from the first attack may be key to explaining how the second attack was accomplished." 0.1471 0.84813 0.77407 0.7895 0.7895 0.01543 0.00451 0.3047 0.0641 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Data Retention. Most organizations have data retention policies that state how long certain types of" 2 18 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86809 0.80134 0.81677 0.81677 0.01543 0.00451 0.3392 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("data may be kept. For example, an organization may state that email messages should be retained for" 0.1471 0.87189 0.81725 0.83268 0.83268 0.01543 0.00451 0.3131 0.0301 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("only 180 days. If a disk image contains thousands of emails, the organization may not want the image" 0.1471 0.87802 0.83331 0.84874 0.84874 0.01543 0.00451 0.3151 0.0321 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("to be kept for more than 180 days unless it is absolutely necessary. As discussed in Section 3.4.2," 0.1471 0.84671 0.84922 0.86465 0.86465 0.01543 0.00451 0.2892 0.0141 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("General Records Schedule (GRS) 24 specifies that incident handling records should be kept for" 0.1471 0.83249 0.86528 0.88071 0.88071 0.01543 0.00451 0.2798 0.0569 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("three years." 0.1471 0.22998 0.88119 0.89662 0.89662 0.01543 0.00451 0.2286 0.0360 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil))
  (51
  ("COMPUTER SECURITY INCIDENT HANDLING GUIDE" 0.58678 0.88244 0.04578 0.05845 0.05791 0.0098 0.00316 0.3184 0.0676 "Arial" 0.0088 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("42" 0.49106 0.5091 0.93891 0.95434 0.95434 0.01543 0.00451 0.0000 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Cost. Original hardware (e.g., hard drives, compromised systems) that is stored as evidence, as well" 2 8 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86571 0.09106 0.1065 0.1065 0.01543 0.00451 0.3551 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("as hard drives and removable media that are used to hold disk images, are generally individually" 0.1471 0.84031 0.107 0.12243 0.12243 0.01543 0.00451 0.2928 0.0150 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("inexpensive. However, if an organization stores many such components for years, the cost can be" 0.1471 0.8464 0.12306 0.13849 0.13849 0.01543 0.00451 0.2901 0.0903 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("substantial. The organization also must retain functional computers that can use the stored hardware" 0.1471 0.86575 0.13897 0.1544 0.1544 0.01543 0.00451 0.2886 0.0815 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("and media." 0.1471 0.22607 0.15503 0.17046 0.17046 0.01543 0.00451 0.3359 0.0261 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#("3.5" 0 3 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.14276 0.18226 0.1978 0.1978 0.01554 0.00501 0.2828 0.0251 "Arial,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  (#("Incident Handling Checklist" 0 27 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.16474 0.40121 0.18226 0.1978 0.1978 0.01554 0.00501 0.3235 0.0692 "Arial,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  ("The checklist in Table 3-5 provides the major steps to be performed in the handling of an incident. Note" 0.11769 0.86677 0.21175 0.23006 0.22879 0.01543 0.00451 0.3080 0.0280 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("that the actual steps performed may vary based on the type of incident and the nature of individual" 0.11769 0.82464 0.22933 0.24476 0.24476 0.01543 0.00451 0.2850 0.0270 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("incidents. For example, if the handler knows exactly what has happened based on analysis of indicators" 0.11769 0.86103 0.2453 0.26073 0.26073 0.01543 0.00451 0.2814 0.0695 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("(Step 1.1), there may be no need to perform Steps 1.2 or 1.3 to further research the activity. The checklist" 0.11769 0.8754 0.26127 0.2767 0.2767 0.01543 0.00451 0.3018 0.0382 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("provides guidelines to handlers on the major steps that should be performed; it does not dictate the exact" 0.11769 0.86792 0.27724 0.29267 0.29267 0.01543 0.00451 0.2858 0.0621 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("sequence of steps that should always be followed." 0.11769 0.47598 0.29321 0.30864 0.30864 0.01543 0.00451 0.2843 0.0660 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#("Table 3-5. Incident Handling Checklist" 0 38 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.36773 0.63247 0.32432 0.33699 0.33699 0.01267 0.00409 0.3281 0.0385 "Arial,Bold" 0.0114 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  (#("Action" 0 6 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.44773 0.49336 0.35554 0.36821 0.36821 0.01267 0.00409 0.3033 0.0456 "Arial,Bold" 0.0114 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  (#("Completed" 0 9 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.79291 0.86908 0.35554 0.36821 0.36821 0.01267 0.00409 0.3023 0.0762 "Arial,Bold" 0.0114 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  (#("Detection and Analysis" 0 22 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.41479 0.57635 0.37432 0.38699 0.38699 0.01267 0.00409 0.2964 0.0672 "Arial,Bold" 0.0114 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  ("1." 0.11769 0.13001 0.39342 0.40609 0.40609 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Determine whether an incident has occurred" 0.17062 0.45889 0.39342 0.40609 0.40609 0.01267 0.00409 0.3284 0.0679 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("1.1" 0.13259 0.15307 0.4122 0.42487 0.42487 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Analyze the precursors and indicators" 0.2116 0.45763 0.4122 0.42487 0.42487 0.01267 0.00409 0.2974 0.0522 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("1.2" 0.13259 0.15307 0.43084 0.44351 0.44351 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Look for correlating information" 0.2116 0.41412 0.43084 0.44351 0.44351 0.01267 0.00409 0.3661 0.0318 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("1.3" 0.13259 0.15307 0.44963 0.4623 0.4623 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Perform research (e.g., search engines, knowledge base)" 0.2116 0.58556 0.44963 0.4623 0.4623 0.01267 0.00409 0.3112 0.0522 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("1.4" 0.13259 0.15307 0.46842 0.48109 0.48109 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("As soon as the handler believes an incident has occurred, begin documenting" 0.2116 0.71632 0.46842 0.48109 0.48109 0.01267 0.00409 0.3120 0.0172 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("the investigation and gathering evidence" 0.2116 0.47481 0.48145 0.49412 0.49412 0.01267 0.00409 0.3127 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("2." 0.11769 0.13001 0.50023 0.5129 0.5129 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Prioritize handling the incident based on the relevant factors (functional impact, information" 0.17062 0.7609 0.50023 0.5129 0.5129 0.01267 0.00409 0.3620 0.0573 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("impact, recoverability effort, etc.)" 0.17062 0.38307 0.51326 0.52593 0.52593 0.01267 0.00409 0.3755 0.0475 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("3." 0.11769 0.13001 0.53205 0.54472 0.54472 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Report the incident to the appropriate internal personnel and external organizations" 0.17062 0.71055 0.53205 0.54472 0.54472 0.01267 0.00409 0.3253 0.0442 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  (#("Containment, Eradication, and Recovery" 0 38 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.3542 0.63707 0.55041 0.56308 0.56308 0.01267 0.00409 0.3102 0.0940 "Arial,Bold" 0.0114 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  ("4." 0.11769 0.13001 0.5695 0.58217 0.58217 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Acquire, preserve, secure, and document evidence" 0.17062 0.50218 0.5695 0.58217 0.58217 0.01267 0.00409 0.2897 0.0540 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("5." 0.11769 0.13001 0.58829 0.60096 0.60096 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Contain the incident" 0.17062 0.30068 0.58829 0.60096 0.60096 0.01267 0.00409 0.3516 0.0509 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("6." 0.11769 0.13001 0.60708 0.61975 0.61975 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Eradicate the incident" 0.17062 0.312 0.60708 0.61975 0.61975 0.01267 0.00409 0.3392 0.0622 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("6.1" 0.13259 0.15312 0.62571 0.63838 0.63838 0.01267 0.00409 0.2790 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Identify and mitigate all vulnerabilities that were exploited" 0.2116 0.58213 0.62571 0.63838 0.63838 0.01267 0.00409 0.3871 0.0475 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("6.2" 0.13259 0.15312 0.6445 0.65717 0.65717 0.01267 0.00409 0.2790 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Remove malware, inappropriate materials, and other components" 0.2116 0.63789 0.6445 0.65717 0.65717 0.01267 0.00409 0.3579 0.0546 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("6.3" 0.13259 0.15307 0.66329 0.67596 0.67596 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("If more affected hosts are discovered (e.g., new malware infections), repeat" 0.2116 0.70245 0.66329 0.67596 0.67596 0.01267 0.00409 0.3504 0.0082 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("the Detection and Analysis steps (1.1, 1.2) to identify all other affected hosts, then" 0.2116 0.74344 0.67647 0.68914 0.68914 0.01267 0.00409 0.3441 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("contain (5) and eradicate (6) the incident for them" 0.2116 0.53334 0.68935 0.70202 0.70202 0.01267 0.00409 0.3503 0.0474 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("7." 0.11769 0.13001 0.70814 0.72081 0.72081 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Recover from the incident" 0.17062 0.33825 0.70814 0.72081 0.72081 0.01267 0.00409 0.3559 0.0549 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("7.1" 0.13259 0.15307 0.72693 0.7396 0.7396 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Return affected systems to an operationally ready state" 0.2116 0.57122 0.72693 0.7396 0.7396 0.01267 0.00409 0.3314 0.0442 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("7.2" 0.13259 0.15307 0.74571 0.75838 0.75838 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Confirm that the affected systems are functioning normally" 0.2116 0.59078 0.74571 0.75838 0.75838 0.01267 0.00409 0.3759 0.0514 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("7.3" 0.13259 0.15307 0.76439 0.77706 0.77706 0.01267 0.00409 0.2819 0.0205 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("If necessary, implement additional monitoring to look for future related activity" 0.2116 0.71454 0.76439 0.77706 0.77706 0.01267 0.00409 0.3806 0.0082 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  (#("Post-Incident Activity" 0 22 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.42047 0.57112 0.78287 0.79554 0.79554 0.01267 0.00409 0.3193 0.0932 "Arial,Bold" 0.0114 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  ("8." 0.11769 0.13001 0.80196 0.81463 0.81463 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Create a follow-up report" 0.17062 0.33247 0.80196 0.81463 0.81463 0.01267 0.00409 0.3576 0.0442 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("9." 0.11769 0.13001 0.82075 0.83342 0.83342 0.01267 0.00409 0.3333 0.0123 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("Hold a lessons learned meeting (mandatory for major incidents, optional otherwise)" 0.17062 0.71094 0.82075 0.83342 0.83342 0.01267 0.00409 0.3598 0.0303 "Arial" 0.0114 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  (#("3.6" 0 3 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.14276 0.85281 0.86836 0.86836 0.01554 0.00501 0.2800 0.0251 "Arial,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  (#("Recommendations" 0 15 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.16474 0.32572 0.85281 0.86836 0.86836 0.01554 0.00501 0.2638 0.1610 "Arial,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  ("The key recommendations presented in this section for handling incidents are summarized below." 0.11769 0.8197 0.88391 0.89934 0.89934 0.01543 0.00451 0.3051 0.0282 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil))
  (52
  ("COMPUTER SECURITY INCIDENT HANDLING GUIDE" 0.58678 0.88244 0.04578 0.05845 0.05791 0.0098 0.00316 0.3183 0.0676 "Arial" 0.0088 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("43" 0.49106 0.5091 0.93891 0.95434 0.95434 0.01543 0.00451 0.0000 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Acquire tools and resources that may be of value during incident handling. The team will be" 2 77 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.84649 0.09106 0.1065 0.1065 0.01543 0.00451 0.3413 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("more efficient at handling incidents if various tools and resources are already available to them." 0.1471 0.83398 0.107 0.12243 0.12243 0.01543 0.00451 0.2829 0.0368 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("Examples include contact lists, encryption software, network diagrams, backup devices, digital" 0.1471 0.83028 0.12306 0.13849 0.13849 0.01543 0.00451 0.3006 0.0709 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("forensic software, and port lists." 0.1471 0.37796 0.13897 0.1544 0.1544 0.01543 0.00451 0.2889 0.0580 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Prevent incidents from occurring by ensuring that networks, systems, and applications are" 2 91 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.84056 0.1667 0.18213 0.18213 0.01543 0.00451 0.3206 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (#("sufficiently secure. Preventing incidents is beneficial to the organization and also reduces the" 0 21 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.1471 0.82246 0.1823 0.19773 0.19773 0.01543 0.00451 0.2567 0.0850 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman,Bold" t)
  ("workload of the incident response team. Performing periodic risk assessments and reducing the" 0.1471 0.83136 0.19821 0.21364 0.21364 0.01543 0.00451 0.2918 0.0680 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("identified risks to an acceptable level are effective in reducing the number of incidents. Awareness of" 0.1471 0.87593 0.21427 0.2297 0.2297 0.01543 0.00451 0.2845 0.0690 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("security policies and procedures by users, IT staff, and management is also very important." 0.1471 0.8012 0.23018 0.24561 0.24561 0.01543 0.00451 0.2965 0.0570 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Identify precursors and indicators through alerts generated by several types of security" 2 90 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.81555 0.25791 0.27334 0.27334 0.01543 0.00451 0.2791 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (#("software. Intrusion detection and prevention systems, antivirus software, and file integrity checking" 0 10 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.1471 0.86707 0.27351 0.28895 0.28895 0.01543 0.00451 0.2867 0.0705 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman,Bold" t)
  ("software are valuable for detecting signs of incidents. Each type of software may detect incidents that" 0.1471 0.87672 0.28942 0.30485 0.30485 0.01543 0.00451 0.2871 0.0621 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("the other types of software cannot, so the use of several types of computer security software is highly" 0.1471 0.87475 0.30548 0.32091 0.32091 0.01543 0.00451 0.2868 0.0221 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("recommended. Third-party monitoring services can also be helpful." 0.1471 0.63178 0.32143 0.33686 0.33686 0.01543 0.00451 0.3016 0.1062 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Establish mechanisms for outside parties to report incidents. Outside parties may want to report" 2 64 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86521 0.34886 0.36429 0.36429 0.01543 0.00451 0.3505 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("incidents to the organization—for example, they may believe that one of the organization’s users is" 0.1471 0.86043 0.36476 0.3802 0.3802 0.01543 0.00451 0.3162 0.0650 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("attacking them. Organizations should publish a phone number and email address that outside parties" 0.1471 0.86701 0.38082 0.39626 0.39626 0.01543 0.00451 0.2949 0.0660 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("can use to report such incidents." 0.1471 0.37787 0.39673 0.41216 0.41216 0.01543 0.00451 0.2508 0.0251 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Require a baseline level of logging and auditing on all systems, and a higher baseline level on all" 2 101 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.87924 0.42431 0.43974 0.43974 0.01543 0.00451 0.3398 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  (#("critical systems. Logs from operating systems, services, and applications frequently provide value" 0 18 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.1471 0.85663 0.44007 0.4555 0.4555 0.01543 0.00451 0.2918 0.0540 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman,Bold" t)
  ("during incident analysis, particularly if auditing was enabled. The logs can provide information such" 0.1471 0.86956 0.45598 0.47141 0.47141 0.01543 0.00451 0.2836 0.0472 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("as which accounts were accessed and what actions were performed." 0.1471 0.63327 0.47204 0.48747 0.48747 0.01543 0.00451 0.2972 0.0150 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Profile networks and systems. Profiling measures the characteristics of expected activity levels so" 2 32 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86233 0.49931 0.51474 0.51474 0.01543 0.00451 0.3256 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("that changes in patterns can be more easily identified. If the profiling process is automated, deviations" 0.1471 0.88045 0.51522 0.53065 0.53065 0.01543 0.00451 0.2837 0.0270 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("from expected activity levels can be detected and reported to administrators quickly, leading to faster" 0.1471 0.87417 0.53128 0.54671 0.54671 0.01543 0.00451 0.2829 0.0352 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("detection of incidents and operational issues." 0.1471 0.46946 0.54721 0.56264 0.56264 0.01543 0.00451 0.2497 0.0660 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Understand the normal behaviors of networks, systems, and applications. Team members who" 2 74 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86032 0.57464 0.59007 0.59007 0.01543 0.00451 0.3421 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("understand normal behavior should be able to recognize abnormal behavior more easily. This" 0.1471 0.81892 0.59055 0.60598 0.60598 0.01543 0.00451 0.2827 0.0790 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("knowledge can best be gained by reviewing log entries and security alerts; the handlers should" 0.1471 0.82602 0.60646 0.62189 0.62189 0.01543 0.00451 0.2701 0.0788 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("become familiar with the typical data and can investigate the unusual entries to gain more knowledge." 0.1471 0.87991 0.62252 0.63795 0.63795 0.01543 0.00451 0.3120 0.0558 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Create a log retention policy. Information regarding an incident may be recorded in several places." 2 33 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86882 0.64979 0.66522 0.66522 0.01543 0.00451 0.3166 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("Creating and implementing a log retention policy that specifies how long log data should be" 0.1471 0.80773 0.66585 0.68128 0.68128 0.01543 0.00451 0.3061 0.0621 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("maintained may be extremely helpful in analysis because older log entries may show reconnaissance" 0.1471 0.87032 0.68176 0.69719 0.69719 0.01543 0.00451 0.2961 0.0799 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("activity or previous instances of similar attacks." 0.1471 0.4898 0.69767 0.7131 0.7131 0.01543 0.00451 0.2821 0.0541 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Perform event correlation. Evidence of an incident may be captured in several logs. Correlating" 2 29 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.84853 0.72509 0.74052 0.74052 0.01543 0.00451 0.3221 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("events among multiple sources can be invaluable in collecting all the available information for an" 0.1471 0.84762 0.741 0.75643 0.75643 0.01543 0.00451 0.2966 0.0460 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("incident and validating whether the incident occurred." 0.1471 0.53487 0.7571 0.77253 0.77253 0.01543 0.00451 0.2749 0.0579 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Keep all host clocks synchronized. If the devices reporting events have inconsistent clock settings," 2 37 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86745 0.78437 0.7998 0.7998 0.01543 0.00451 0.3080 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("event correlation will be more complicated. Clock discrepancies may also cause issues from an" 0.1471 0.83081 0.80028 0.81571 0.81571 0.01543 0.00451 0.3101 0.0389 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("evidentiary standpoint." 0.1471 0.31192 0.81634 0.83177 0.83177 0.01543 0.00451 0.2503 0.0811 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Maintain and use a knowledge base of information. Handlers need to reference information" 2 52 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.82678 0.84362 0.85905 0.85905 0.01543 0.00451 0.3497 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("quickly during incident analysis; a centralized knowledge base provides a consistent, maintainable" 0.1471 0.85497 0.85968 0.87511 0.87511 0.01543 0.00451 0.2705 0.0541 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("source of information. The knowledge base should include general information, such as data on" 0.1471 0.83487 0.87558 0.89101 0.89101 0.01543 0.00451 0.2884 0.0470 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("precursors and indicators of previous incidents." 0.1471 0.48765 0.89164 0.90707 0.90707 0.01543 0.00451 0.2430 0.0750 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil))
  (53
  ("COMPUTER SECURITY INCIDENT HANDLING GUIDE" 0.58678 0.88244 0.04578 0.05845 0.05791 0.0098 0.00316 0.3183 0.0676 "Arial" 0.0088 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("44" 0.49106 0.5091 0.93891 0.95434 0.95434 0.01543 0.00451 0.0000 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Start recording all information as soon as the team suspects that an incident has occurred." 2 93 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.8376 0.09137 0.1068 0.1068 0.01543 0.00451 0.3233 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("Every step taken, from the time the incident was detected to its final resolution, should be" 0.1471 0.79163 0.107 0.12243 0.12243 0.01543 0.00451 0.3108 0.0429 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("documented and timestamped. Information of this nature can serve as evidence in a court of law if" 0.1471 0.8532 0.12306 0.13849 0.13849 0.01543 0.00451 0.3125 0.0880 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("legal prosecution is pursued. Recording the steps performed can also lead to a more efficient," 0.1471 0.81722 0.13897 0.1544 0.1544 0.01543 0.00451 0.2882 0.0350 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("systematic, and less error-prone handling of the problem." 0.1471 0.55772 0.15503 0.17046 0.17046 0.01543 0.00451 0.2953 0.0805 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Safeguard incident data. It often contains sensitive information regarding such things as" 2 27 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.79214 0.1823 0.19773 0.19773 0.01543 0.00451 0.3101 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("vulnerabilities, security breaches, and users that may have performed inappropriate actions. The team" 0.1471 0.87651 0.19821 0.21364 0.21364 0.01543 0.00451 0.2877 0.1074 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("should ensure that access to incident data is restricted properly, both logically and physically." 0.1471 0.8184 0.21427 0.2297 0.2297 0.01543 0.00451 0.2583 0.0480 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Prioritize handling of the incidents based on the relevant factors. Because of resource limitations," 2 70 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.87853 0.24154 0.25698 0.25698 0.01543 0.00451 0.3151 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("incidents should not be handled on a first-come, first-served basis. Instead, organizations should" 0.1471 0.83845 0.25761 0.27304 0.27304 0.01543 0.00451 0.2664 0.0650 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("establish written guidelines that outline how quickly the team must respond to the incident and what" 0.1471 0.86731 0.27351 0.28895 0.28895 0.01543 0.00451 0.3161 0.0631 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("actions should be performed, based on relevant factors such as the functional and information impact" 0.1471 0.87311 0.28942 0.30485 0.30485 0.01543 0.00451 0.2869 0.0511 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("of the incident, and the likely recoverability from the incident. This saves time for the incident" 0.1471 0.82561 0.30548 0.32091 0.32091 0.01543 0.00451 0.3013 0.0150 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("handlers and provides a justification to management and system owners for their actions." 0.1471 0.78617 0.32143 0.33686 0.33686 0.01543 0.00451 0.3024 0.0611 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("Organizations should also establish an escalation process for those instances when the team does not" 0.1471 0.87022 0.33749 0.35292 0.35292 0.01543 0.00451 0.2767 0.1009 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("respond to an incident within the designated time." 0.1471 0.50537 0.3534 0.36883 0.36883 0.01543 0.00451 0.3107 0.0570 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Include provisions regarding incident reporting in the organization’s incident response policy." 2 97 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.86773 0.38113 0.39656 0.39656 0.01543 0.00451 0.2912 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("Organizations should specify which incidents must be reported, when they must be reported, and to" 0.1471 0.86217 0.39673 0.41216 0.41216 0.01543 0.00451 0.3027 0.1009 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("whom. The parties most commonly notified are the CIO, head of information security, local" 0.1471 0.80766 0.41264 0.42807 0.42807 0.01543 0.00451 0.3478 0.0492 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("information security officer, other incident response teams within the organization, and system" 0.1471 0.8282 0.4287 0.44413 0.44413 0.01543 0.00451 0.3045 0.0850 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("owners." 0.1471 0.20371 0.44461 0.46004 0.46004 0.01543 0.00451 0.3115 0.0566 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Establish strategies and procedures for containing incidents. It is important to contain incidents" 2 64 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.8617 0.47204 0.48747 0.48747 0.01543 0.00451 0.3180 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("quickly and effectively to limit their business impact. Organizations should define acceptable risks in" 0.1471 0.87502 0.48795 0.50338 0.50338 0.01543 0.00451 0.2915 0.0541 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("containing incidents and develop strategies and procedures accordingly. Containment strategies" 0.1471 0.83409 0.50386 0.51929 0.51929 0.01543 0.00451 0.2594 0.0760 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("should vary based on the type of incident." 0.1471 0.44778 0.51992 0.53535 0.53535 0.01543 0.00451 0.2603 0.0480 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Follow established procedures for evidence gathering and handling. The team should clearly" 2 69 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.84336 0.54721 0.56264 0.56264 0.01543 0.00451 0.3089 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("document how all evidence has been preserved. Evidence should be accounted for at all times. The" 0.1471 0.8588 0.56327 0.57871 0.57871 0.01543 0.00451 0.2871 0.0709 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("team should meet with legal staff and law enforcement agencies to discuss evidence handling, then" 0.1471 0.85829 0.57918 0.59461 0.59461 0.01543 0.00451 0.3044 0.0352 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("develop procedures based on those discussions." 0.1471 0.48867 0.59509 0.61052 0.61052 0.01543 0.00451 0.2209 0.0570 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Capture volatile data from systems as evidence. This includes lists of network connections," 2 50 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.82334 0.62252 0.63795 0.63795 0.01543 0.00451 0.3410 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("processes, login sessions, open files, network interface configurations, and the contents of memory." 0.1471 0.86203 0.63843 0.65386 0.65386 0.01543 0.00451 0.2854 0.0735 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("Running carefully chosen commands from trusted media can collect the necessary information" 0.1471 0.8275 0.65449 0.66992 0.66992 0.01543 0.00451 0.3029 0.0621 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("without damaging the system’s evidence." 0.1471 0.4444 0.6704 0.68583 0.68583 0.01543 0.00451 0.3143 0.0550 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Obtain system snapshots through full forensic disk images, not file system backups. Disk images" 2 86 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.87869 0.69767 0.7131 0.7131 0.01543 0.00451 0.3573 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("should be made to sanitized write-protectable or write-once media. This process is superior to a file" 0.1471 0.86189 0.71373 0.72916 0.72916 0.01543 0.00451 0.3057 0.0480 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("system backup for investigatory and evidentiary purposes. Imaging is also valuable in that it is much" 0.1471 0.87093 0.72964 0.74507 0.74507 0.01543 0.00451 0.2951 0.0501 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("safer to analyze an image than it is to perform analysis on the original system because the analysis" 0.1471 0.85313 0.7457 0.76113 0.76113 0.01543 0.00451 0.2938 0.0350 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("may inadvertently alter the original." 0.1471 0.4052 0.76165 0.77708 0.77708 0.01543 0.00451 0.3000 0.0310 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#(" Hold lessons learned meetings after major incidents. Lessons learned meetings are extremely" 2 55 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.84017 0.78892 0.80435 0.80435 0.01543 0.00451 0.3409 0.0180 "Times New Roman,Bold" 0.0139 t nil 0 "ABCDEE+Webdings" nil)
  ("helpful in improving security measures and the incident handling process itself." 0.1471 0.71849 0.80498 0.82041 0.82041 0.01543 0.00451 0.2840 0.0510 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil))
  (54
  ("COMPUTER SECURITY INCIDENT HANDLING GUIDE" 0.58678 0.88244 0.04578 0.05845 0.05791 0.0098 0.00316 0.3183 0.0676 "Arial" 0.0088 nil nil 0 "Arial" nil)
  ("45" 0.49106 0.5091 0.93891 0.95434 0.95434 0.01543 0.00451 0.0000 0.0180 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (#("4." 0 2 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.11769 0.13412 0.09311 0.11 0.11 0.01689 0.00545 0.3494 0.0164 "Arial,Bold" 0.0152 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  (#("Coordination and Information Sharing" 0 36 (pdf-text-emph bold)) 0.16474 0.51897 0.09311 0.11 0.11 0.01689 0.00545 0.3219 0.1220 "Arial,Bold" 0.0152 t nil 0 "Arial,Bold" t)
  ("The nature of contemporary threats and attacks makes it more important than ever for organizations to" 0.11769 0.85288 0.12745 0.14288 0.14288 0.01543 0.00451 0.3009 0.0282 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("work together during incident response. Organizations should ensure that they effectively coordinate" 0.11769 0.84131 0.14336 0.15879 0.15879 0.01543 0.00451 0.2654 0.0370 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("portions of their incident response activities with appropriate partners. The most important aspect of" 0.11769 0.83761 0.15942 0.17485 0.17485 0.01543 0.00451 0.2966 0.0590 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("incident response coordination is information sharing, where different organizations share threat, attack," 0.11769 0.86646 0.17533 0.19076 0.19076 0.01543 0.00451 0.2707 0.0579 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("and vulnerability information with each other so that each organization’s knowledge benefits the other." 0.11769 0.85879 0.19139 0.20682 0.20682 0.01543 0.00451 0.2852 0.0261 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("Incident information sharing is frequently mutually beneficial because the same threats and attacks often" 0.11769 0.86995 0.2073 0.22273 0.22273 0.01543 0.00451 0.2837 0.0589 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("affect multiple organizations simultaneously." 0.11769 0.44201 0.22321 0.23864 0.23864 0.01543 0.00451 0.3020 0.0411 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (" " nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil)
  ("As mentioned in Section 2, coordinating and sharing information with partner organizations can" 0.11769 0.80837 0.25518 0.27061 0.27061 0.01543 0.00451 0.2999 0.0199 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("strengthen the organization’s ability to effectively respond to IT incidents. For example, if an organization" 0.11769 0.88254 0.27124 0.28667 0.28667 0.01543 0.00451 0.2768 0.0750 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("identifies some behavior on its network that seems suspicious and sends information about the event to a" 0.11769 0.87072 0.28715 0.30258 0.30258 0.01543 0.00451 0.2985 0.0670 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("set of trusted partners, someone else in that network may have already seen similar behavior and be able" 0.11769 0.86777 0.30306 0.31849 0.31849 0.01543 0.00451 0.2965 0.0201 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("to respond with additional details about the suspicious activity, including signatures, other indicators to" 0.11769 0.86018 0.31916 0.33459 0.33459 0.01543 0.00451 0.2754 0.0141 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("look for, or suggested remediation actions. Collaboration with the trusted partner can enable an" 0.11769 0.80232 0.33507 0.3505 0.3505 0.01543 0.00451 0.2882 0.0321 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("organization to respond to the incident more quickly and efficiently than an organization operating in" 0.11769 0.84562 0.35113 0.36656 0.36656 0.01543 0.00451 0.2709 0.0899 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("isolation." 0.11769 0.18435 0.36704 0.38247 0.38247 0.01543 0.00451 0.2776 0.0667 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (" " nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil)
  ("This increase in efficiency for standard incident response techniques is not the only incentive for cross-" 0.11769 0.86009 0.39901 0.41444 0.41444 0.01543 0.00451 0.2520 0.0321 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("organization coordination and information sharing. Another incentive for information sharing is the" 0.11769 0.83376 0.41492 0.43035 0.43035 0.01543 0.00451 0.2879 0.0899 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("ability to respond to incidents using techniques that may not be available to a single organization," 0.11769 0.81835 0.43098 0.44641 0.44641 0.01543 0.00451 0.2797 0.0461 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("especially if that organization is small to medium size. For example, a small organization that identifies a" 0.11769 0.8746 0.44689 0.46232 0.46232 0.01543 0.00451 0.3247 0.0721 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("particularly complex instance of malware on its network may not have the in-house resources to fully" 0.11769 0.8472 0.46295 0.47838 0.47838 0.01543 0.00451 0.3070 0.0831 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("analyze the malware and determine its effect on the system. In this case, the organization may be able to" 0.11769 0.86761 0.47886 0.49429 0.49429 0.01543 0.00451 0.3167 0.0548 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("leverage a trusted information sharing network to effectively outsource the analysis of this malware to" 0.11769 0.85275 0.49476 0.5102 0.5102 0.01543 0.00451 0.2963 0.0609 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("third party resources that have the adequate technical capabilities to perform the malware analysis." 0.11769 0.82587 0.51082 0.52626 0.52626 0.01543 0.00451 0.2855 0.0341 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  (" " nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil nil)
  ("This section of the document highlights coordination and information sharing. Section 4.1 presents an" 0.11769 0.85031 0.54282 0.55825 0.55825 0.01543 0.00451 0.2861 0.0321 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
  ("overview of incident response coordination and focuses on the need for cross-organization coordination to" 0.11769 0.882 0.55873 0.57416 0.57416 0.01543 0.00451 0.2509 0.0669 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
