  ("As discussed in Section 2.3.4, an organization may need to interact with several types of external" 0.11769 0.81532 0.66964 0.68507 0.68507 0.01543 0.00451 0.2937 0.0199 "Times New Roman" 0.0139 nil nil 0 "Times New Roman" nil)
